152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 84 0 R
/E (     During this service year, all of the officers will be meeting 4 times in total, one being during the summer, and do  simple little projects. We will also be going over updates and future plans for each club. This may include how many members you have, hours served, who who is planning to go to certain events, favorite service project, and goals for each club. We will also be going over potential projects to do as a division and you will be getting a detailed update from the district. The second meeting will be in November and is required for all schools to attend. Please keep reading to find more information and action on your side. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
